<title>USA: Forcenergy buys Alaskan oil stakes.</title>
<headline>Forcenergy buys Alaskan oil stakes.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forcenergy Inc said Tuesday it has completed the previously announced acquisition of Marathon Oil Co's interest in the McArthur River Field and Trading Bay Field in the Cook Inlet area and the Prudhoe Bay Unit.</p>
<p>The final acquisition price, subject to post-closing adjustments, was $97.8 million, equating to about $4.16 per proven barrel of crude oil, Forcenergy said,</p>
<p>The company expects to close on the acquisition of Marathon's interest in the Cook Inlet Pipe Line Co during the second half of January, pending the waiver of preferential purchase rights held by other parties.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
